  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Consolidation of the peace-building community of practice, Sistema de Paz (SIP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Local peacebuilding efforts, essential for long-term peace, are rarely seen beyond the communities in which they occur. Corporacin Consorcio para el Desarrollo Comunitario (Consorcio) works closely with the Corporacin Sistema de Comunicacin para la Paz (SIPAZ) to consolidate a community of practice, Sistema de Paz, with at least 17 other IAF grantee partners. At the IAF, we support community-led solutions to enhance peace and security. Consorcio&apos;s activities strengthen grassroots organizations through education and training and build peer-to-peer learning and action networks. This grant is part of the IAF&apos;s broader initiative to build a just and lasting peace in Colombia.</narrative>
  </description>
